<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 337-7 AT LUNCH, SECOND DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 337-7 AT LUNCH, SECOND DAY.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were 337 for seven at lunch on the second day of the first test against England on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 337-7 (A.Flower 94 not out; A.Campbell 84)</p>
</text>
